        "system": {
          "description": "<p>Genehackers have resurrected a number of extinct dinosaur species as small, colorful, and lovable pets. Varieties include pterosaurs, stegosauruses, ankylosauruses, triceratops, and many others.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Note: Movement Rate is Walker OR Winged as appropriate.</p>",
